| Component             | Software       |
| --------------------- | -------------- |
| Growth prediction     | gRodon2        |
| rRNA prediction       | Barrnap        |
| Functional annotation | eggNOG-mapper  |
| CAZyme annotation     | dbCAN          |
| Defense systems       | DefenseFinder  |
| CRISPR systems        | CRISPRCasTyper |
| Functional traits     | microTrait     |
| Prophages             | PhiSpy         |
| IS elements           | ISEScan        |
| Gene prediction       | Prodigal       |
| Protein annotation    | HMMER          |
| Ordination analysis   | ade4 (MCOA)    |

---

# Computational Environment

All analyses were performed on the Rice University NOTSX High-Performance Computing Cluster using Slurm-based batch processing workflows.

