---

# Reproducibility

All scripts required to reproduce the analyses are provided in this repository. Individual subdirectories contain software-specific documentation, required databases, execution commands, input formats, and output descriptions.

The complete workflow can be reproduced starting from bacterial genome assemblies and phage genome datasets, provided that the external databases required by each software package are installed.

